  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When the Eastern Sea alliance army arrives with over ten Immortal Gu Houses to face the variant human alliance, this warship is the only rank eight Immortal Gu House among those present. Eastern Sea leads the five regions in Immortal Gu House numbers, surpassing even Central Continent, yet has very few peak rank eight houses of the class of Dragon Palace or Myriad Year Flying Warship. Houses at rank six are most common in that force, then rank seven.",
      "chapters": [
        2069
      ],
