        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Green Cloud Spark Warship is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Eastern Sea’s Hua clan, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hua_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When countless sword feathers form bright bladewings that cut through the battlefield, other Immortal Gu Houses look extremely fragile; only Green Cloud Spark Warship resists them.",
      "chapters": [
        2070
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bladewing-resistance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Spectral Soul destroys the sun and temperatures fall, Hua clan’s rank eight Immortal Gu House Green Cloud Spark Warship enters the two heavens and collects a vast amount of cloud path resources, which draws deep envy from other Eastern Sea righteous path forces.",
